        "@value": "Términos que definen el material que constituye parte o la totalidad de la unidad geológica."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The material that comprises part or all of the geologic unit. Description: This refers to a vocabulary of lithological terms."
      }
    ],
